    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Server-Side Composition delivers superior initial page load performance. Users receive a complete HTML document on the first response-no JavaScript execution required to see content. This improves Core Web Vitals (First Contentful Paint, Largest Contentful Paint), benefits SEO, and provides a functional baseline for users with JavaScript disabled or slow devices. The pattern also reduces client-side complexity-no sophisticated routing or lazy loading logic needed to coordinate micro-frontends."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
